    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] flies up to its Fly Speed, shedding grave dust. Each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=jjHZ0sa9Ihw0qnC5]] within [[lookup @target.template.size activity=jjHZ0sa9Ihw0qnC5]]-feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]] as it moves is targeted once by the following effect. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=jjHZ0sa9Ihw0qnC5]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] condition until the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s next turn. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.</p>",
